		<div class="topic" id="forum_op_topic_571544064825170179">
		Will AI assets be in the final release of the game?	</div>
	<div class="content" id="forum_op_content_571544064825170179">
		I'm probably gonna save my money for something else if the AI stuff remains in the game	</div>
		
