<script type="text/javascript">
	$J( function() {
		InitializeForumTopic( {"owner":"45620894","type":"General","feature":"0","gidforum":"597406481786078325","forum_display_name":"Bruisers General","forum_url":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/app\/3740090\/discussions\/0\/","forum_search_url":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/app\/3740090\/discussions\/search\/","is_public":1,"permissions":{"can_view":1,"can_post":1,"can_reply":1,"is_banned":0,"can_delete":0,"can_edit":0},"appid":3740090}, "https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/forum\/45620894\/General\/",
		"571544064825170179", {"author":"Kurb","text":"I'm probably gonna save my money for something else if the AI stuff remains in the game"}		);
			} );
</script>
										<script type="text/javascript">
$J( function() { InitializeCommentThread( "ForumTopic", "ForumTopic_103582791475142302_597406481786078325_571544064825170179", {"feature":"597406481786078325","feature2":"571544064825170179","owner":"103582791475142302","commentthreadid":"644213520","total_count":93,"start":0,"pagesize":15,"has_upvoted":0,"upvotes":0,"votecountid":null,"voteupid":null,"commentcountid":null,"subscribed":false,"extended_data":"{\"topic_permissions\":{\"can_view\":1,\"can_post\":1,\"can_reply\":1,\"is_banned\":0,\"can_delete\":0,\"can_edit\":0},\"original_poster\":126098470,\"topic_gidanswer\":\"0\",\"forum_appid\":3740090,\"forum_public\":1,\"forum_type\":\"General\",\"forum_gidfeature\":\"0\"}","oldestfirst":true,"comments_raw":{"590684983954487719":{"text":"Who cares. Shut up already.","author":"DiLLiGaF"},"590685251875938808":{"text":"[quote=DiLLiGaF;590684983954487719]Who cares. Shut up already. [\/quote]\nWomp womp. I wasn't asking you","author":"Kurb"},"589560061703220603":{"text":"[quote=TheRogueFedora;589560061703198583]AI isn't scary, Boomer. [\/quote]\nIt's indicative of low standards and quality. If you're making people pay for something your team couldn't be bothered to make themselves, then why should I waste my time and money on it when I can put it towards a game that doesn't use AI? The best games I've played are made by people who put effort into every aspect of the game. I'm not going to buy something from a developer that doesn't","author":"Kurb"},"589560061703242100":{"text":"The store page indicates that at the moment, there are some AI assets and the voices are genAI, and it doesn't indicate that they are going to be replaced. We won't know for sure until release, but it does seem like there will be some.","author":"TheDarkAdonis"},"589560607314820056":{"text":"Bro.... How the fuck are we supposed to know?","author":"\u239b\u239dGilgamesh\u23a0\u239e"},"589560607314888274":{"text":"[quote=\u239b\u239dGilgamesh\u23a0\u239e;589560607314820056]Bro.... How the fuck are we supposed to know? [\/quote]\nIf you're asking how you're supposed to know what assets are AI, I'm fairly certain the portraits are. It's pretty easy to see that like the shady figures in the trailer are AI","author":"Kurb"},"588435120315230686":{"text":"bro if it helps make a good game what is there to cry about? you anti ai freaks are so fucking corny lmao","author":"BATTLE BEAST"},"588435120315272095":{"text":"[quote=BATTLE BEAST;588435120315230686]bro if it helps make a good game what is there to cry about? you anti ai freaks are so fucking corny lmao [\/quote]\nBecause I don't like how it looks. The ai generated portraits trying to be both realistic and pixelated just look like they don't fit with the rest of the game.\n\ndickriding ai is way more corny than having quality standards","author":"Kurb"},"588435120315358477":{"text":"[quote=TheRogueFedora;588435120315330131][quote=Kurb;588435120315272095]\nBecause I don't like how it looks. The ai generated portraits trying to be both realistic and pixelated just look like they don't fit with the rest of the game.\n\ndickriding ai is way more corny than having quality standards [\/quote]\n\nNot really, being Anti AI is like being the old man who yells at the cloud. Okay, Boomer? [\/quote]\nA bad strawman argument doesn't change the fact the assets look bad. If other, games with better gameplay and no AI assets exist on the marketplace, there's no reason to spend money on it in comparison\n\nThe boomer comment doesn't hit as hard with a profile picture like yours","author":"Kurb"},"588435120315438351":{"text":"[quote=TheRogueFedora;588435120315406346][quote=Kurb;588435120315358477]\nA bad strawman argument doesn't change the fact the assets look bad. If other, games with better gameplay and no AI assets exist on the marketplace, there's no reason to spend money on it in comparison\n\nThe boomer comment doesn't hit as hard with a profile picture like yours [\/quote]\n\nMy profile picture is literally me, my dude. [\/quote]\n\nExactly. You're calling someone else a boomer when look like you've lived through two recessions; The financial one, and another for your hairline","author":"Kurb"},"586183630898917305":{"text":"[quote=TheRogueFedora;586183630898888866][quote=Kurb;588435120315438351]\n\nExactly. You're calling someone else a boomer when look like you've lived through two recessions; The financial one, and another for your hairline [\/quote]\n\nDon't think you know what a Boomer is. I'm 46, I'm a Gen Z\/Millennial depending on who defines the years. [\/quote]\nA 40 year old neckbeard calling anyone else a boomer is one of the saddest things I've seen in the steam forums. I'm literally half your age and you're calling me a boomer like you're still hip with the kids LMAO","author":"Kurb"},"586183630898963904":{"text":"Is this woke?","author":"Kacho"},"586183630898964438":{"text":"[quote=Kacho;586183630898963904]Is this woke? [\/quote]\nNah I just don't like how the assets look. I'd much prefer if they were more in line with the artstyle of the sprites","author":"Kurb"},"586183630899012446":{"text":"[quote=TheRogueFedora;586183630898965205][quote=Kurb;586183630898917305]\nA 40 year old neckbeard calling anyone else a boomer is one of the saddest things I've seen in the steam forums. I'm literally half your age and you're calling me a boomer like you're still hip with the kids LMAO [\/quote]\n\nobviously having a lot more fun in life than your crabby ass. [\/quote]\nNah you're the one who threw insults at me first over a single inquiry about the game voicing an opinion that only really matters to me. You're literally a 46 year old balding neckbeard trying to talk down to someone in the steam forums just to defend AI assets that kinda look like ass in game. I think that's more pathetic than anything I've said so far","author":"Kurb"},"586183630899031810":{"text":"lol","author":"Tatsu"}},"track_navigation":true}, 'https://steamcommunity.com/comment/ForumTopic/', 40 ); } );
</script>
<div class="commentthread_area forumtopic_comments" id="commentthread_ForumTopic_103582791475142302_597406481786078325_571544064825170179_area">
	        <div id="commentthread_ForumTopic_103582791475142302_597406481786078325_571544064825170179_pagectn" class="forum_paging" style="">
            <div class="forum_paging_controls" id="commentthread_ForumTopic_103582791475142302_597406481786078325_571544064825170179_pagecontrols">
